    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The dark knight empowers his weapon with the abyss and unleashes a deadly overhead strike, causing a column of darkness to erupt from his foe. The dark knight makes a melee touch attack as a standard action, if the attack hits it deals double weapon damage. If the target dies by this attack, all foes who see the attack within 60 feet of the slain foe must make a Will save (DC 10 + half of dark knight's level + his Charisma modifier) or be Frightened for 1 round. The status effect is a mind-affecting effect.</p>",
